@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

box Logic LOGIC_COLOR_T1
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":EditCommandParser" as EditParser LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ParserUtil" as ParserUtil LOGIC_COLOR
participant "e:EditCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box
box Model MODEL_COLOR_T1
participant "live:Model" as Live MODEL_COLOR
participant "pending:ModelManager" as Pending MODEL_COLOR
end box
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

[-> Logic : execute("edit i/A0123456B dl/Tutorial 1 l/Tutorial 2")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(commandText)
activate Parser
create EditParser
Parser -> EditParser : new EditCommandParser()
Parser -> EditParser : parse(arguments)
activate EditParser
note right of EditParser
Check the command structure and collect label changes.
Invalid input throws ParseException before execution.
end note
EditParser -> ParserUtil : parseStudentId(), parseLabel() for each label
ParserUtil --> EditParser : validated values
create Command
EditParser -> Command : new EditCommand(studentId, descriptor)
EditParser --> Parser : e
deactivate EditParser
destroy EditParser
Parser --> Logic : e
deactivate Parser

Logic -> Command : isModifyingData()
Command --> Logic : true
note over Logic
Block this edit if startup loading failed.
end note
Logic -> Live : getAddressBook(), getUserPrefs(), getFilteredPersonListPredicate()
Live --> Logic : records, preferences, filter
create Pending
Logic -> Pending : new ModelManager(records, preferences)
Logic -> Pending : updateFilteredPersonList(filter::test)
Logic -> Command : execute(pending)
activate Command
Command -> Pending : getAddressBook().getPersonList()
Pending --> Command : complete student list
note right of Command
Find A0123456B even if hidden by the current filter.
Copy the student's labels, remove Tutorial 1,
then add Tutorial 2 using case-insensitive matching.
Retain the other fields, including attendance.
An invalid change throws CommandException before saving.
end note
Command -> Pending : setPerson(original, edited)
Command -> Pending : updateFilteredPersonList(showAll)
Command --> Logic : success result
deactivate Command

Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(pending.getAddressBook())
activate Storage
alt save succeeds
Storage --> Logic : saved
Logic -> Live : setAddressBook(pending.getAddressBook())
Logic -> Live : updateFilteredPersonList(pending filter)
[<-- Logic : success result
else save fails
Storage --> Logic : IOException
note over Live
Live records and filter remain unchanged.
end note
[<-- Logic : CommandException (save error)
end
deactivate Storage
deactivate Logic
@enduml
